  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "道具いらずの簡単組み立て！初めてでも簡単に組み立てられる「ポケプラクイック!!」にクワッスが仲間入り！",
      "en": "Easy assembly without any tools! Kwass joins the \"Pokepla Quick!!\" that can be easily assembled even for the first time!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 全高約90mm。集めたくなる魅力的な可愛いポーズを楽しもう。",
      "en": "• Overall height approximately 90mm. Enjoy the cute poses that make you want to collect them."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• こだわりのパーツ分割で簡単組み立て＆カラフルな仕上がりを両立。",
      "en": "• Easy assembly and colorful finish achieved by carefully dividing parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 特徴的なつやのある頭の毛を成形品で再現。",
      "en": "• The characteristic glossy hair on the head is reproduced with a molded product."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ランナーを見た瞬間、出来上がりが思い浮かぶシンプル仕様。",
      "en": "• Simple specifications that make you imagine the finished product the moment you see the Runner."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 道具を使わないタッチゲート方式。",
      "en": "• Touch gate method without tools."
    }
  ],
